1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,242
Mada ya leo ni nini? Ni safari ya kutembelea maeneo matakatifu ya anime.

2
00:00:08,242 --> 00:00:11,242
Sehemu ya 1: Safari ya Kutembelea Maeneo Matakatifu ya Anime – Kitenzi Chako

3
00:00:11,242 --> 00:00:18,809
Leo tutaanza safari yetu ya kutembelea maeneo matakatifu ya anime.

4
00:00:18,832 --> 00:00:22,380
Ndiyo, ninafurahi sana.

5
00:00:22,403 --> 00:00:25,670
Tunapoanza, tutakwenda wapi kwanza?

6
00:00:25,694 --> 00:00:33,254
Ni Hekalu la Suga huko Yotsuya, lililoonekana kwenye filamu 'Kitenzi Chako'.

7
00:00:33,277 --> 00:00:39,743
Aa, ndio hicho hekalu chenye ngazi nyekundu maarufu, sivyo?

8
00:00:39,766 --> 00:00:42,565
Ndiyo.

9
00:00:42,589 --> 00:00:47,256
Ni mahali muhimu ambapo wahusika wawili walikutana.

10
00:00:47,279 --> 00:00:51,816
Ni umbali gani kutoka stesheni kwa miguu?

11
00:00:51,839 --> 00:00:55,739
Kama dakika kumi kwa miguu.

12
00:00:55,762 --> 00:00:59,732
Ni bahati nzuri kwamba hali ya hewa ni nzuri.

13
00:00:59,756 --> 00:01:02,656
Aa, tunaiona.

14
00:01:02,679 --> 00:01:05,712
Ni ngazi zile.

15
00:01:05,735 --> 00:01:12,118
Inaonekana kama kwenye filamu kabisa!

16
00:01:12,142 --> 00:01:15,409
Ndiyo, kweli.

17
00:01:15,431 --> 00:01:20,698
Wageni wengi wanapiga picha hapa.

18
00:01:20,721 --> 00:01:25,788
Tupige picha yetu kwa pembe ileile.

19
00:01:25,811 --> 00:01:28,144
Sawa, nzuri.

20
00:01:28,167 --> 00:01:32,438
Wewe panda ngazi.

21
00:01:32,462 --> 00:01:34,995
Sawa, nimeelewa.

22
00:01:35,018 --> 00:01:39,252
Mimi nitakuwa hapa chini nikatazama.

23
00:01:39,275 --> 00:01:43,073
Basi, nitapiga picha sasa.

24
00:01:43,096 --> 00:01:48,269
Sawa, chizi!

25
00:01:48,292 --> 00:01:51,276
Picha imetoka vizuri?

26
00:01:51,299 --> 00:01:56,166
Ndiyo, picha nzuri sana.

27
00:01:56,189 --> 00:01:59,822
Inaonekana kama bango la filamu.

28
00:01:59,845 --> 00:02:02,822
Ninashangilia.

29
00:02:02,846 --> 00:02:08,079
Karibu na hekalu hapa kuna maeneo mengine ya kuvutia.

30
00:02:08,102 --> 00:02:10,896
Ni maeneo gani?

31
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:16,086
Kuna barabara ya kuvuka na sanduku la posta kama zilivyo katika filamu.

32
00:02:16,109 --> 00:02:20,342
Aa, nataka kuyaona pia.

33
00:02:20,365 --> 00:02:22,865
Twende pamoja.

34
00:02:22,888 --> 00:02:26,355
Ndiyo, twende.

35
00:02:26,378 --> 00:02:30,411
Baada ya hapo, tutaenda mahali pengine pa kutembelea.

36
00:02:30,434 --> 00:02:33,146
Sawa, nimeelewa.

37
00:02:33,170 --> 00:02:35,870
Tutakwenda wapi baadaye?

38
00:02:35,893 --> 00:02:41,593
Tutakwenda Hekalu la Kanda karibu na Akihabara.

39
00:02:41,616 --> 00:02:48,721
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua tena video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kuondolewa bila tahadhari.

40
00:02:48,721 --> 00:02:51,721
Sehemu ya 2: Uvutio wa Akihabara na Hekalu la Kanda

41
00:02:51,721 --> 00:02:56,878
Tumefika karibu na Akihabara.

42
00:02:56,901 --> 00:03:02,375
Kutembea katika mtaa wa umeme ni furaha sana.

43
00:03:02,398 --> 00:03:10,745
Leo tutatembelea Hekalu maarufu la Kanda, ambalo ni eneo takatifu la anime.

44
00:03:10,768 --> 00:03:17,002
Hekalu la Kanda ni hekalu la kale sana, sivyo?

45
00:03:17,025 --> 00:03:19,858
Ndiyo.

46
00:03:19,881 --> 00:03:26,867
Wahusika wa anime walikuwa wakifanya mazoezi hapa kila siku.

47
00:03:26,891 --> 00:03:32,624
Ni ngazi ndefu zilizopo ndani ya hekalu?

48
00:03:32,647 --> 00:03:36,147
Ndiyo.

49
00:03:36,170 --> 00:03:41,303
Ni ngazi zinazoitwa 'Otoko-zaka'.

50
00:03:41,326 --> 00:03:45,093
Aa, ndizo hizi.

51
00:03:45,116 --> 00:03:51,029
Ziko juu na zina mtelemko mkali kuliko nilivyofikiria.

52
00:03:51,053 --> 00:03:57,686
Wahusika wa anime walikuwa wakikimbia kupanda ngazi hizi.

53
00:03:57,709 --> 00:04:01,443
Hiyo ni nzuri sana!

54
00:04:01,466 --> 00:04:06,848
Ninahisi ninachoka kwa kutembea tu.

55
00:04:06,871 --> 00:04:12,904
Twende pamoja polepole mpaka juu.

56
00:04:12,927 --> 00:04:15,664
Ndiyo.

57
00:04:15,687 --> 00:04:19,205
Tukae kupanda hatua kwa hatua.

58
00:04:19,229 --> 00:04:23,495
Tumefika juu!

59
00:04:23,518 --> 00:04:26,864
Mandhari ni nzuri sana, sivyo?

60
00:04:26,888 --> 00:04:34,022
Kuna ema (pembe za kidini) nyingi za anime ndani ya hekalu hili!

61
00:04:34,045 --> 00:04:40,745
Wapenzi wanaichora picha na kuandika matakwa yao.

62
00:04:40,767 --> 00:04:46,122
Unaweza kuona upendo wa wapenzi kutoka duniani kote!

63
00:04:46,146 --> 00:04:52,296
Kuna pia hirizi ndogo ndani ya hekalu hili.

64
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:56,953
Hirizi za wahusika wa anime?

65
00:04:56,976 --> 00:05:02,410
Ndiyo, hirizi maalum za ushirikiano.

66
00:05:02,432 --> 00:05:07,132
Hiyo ni zawadi nzuri kwa ajili ya kumbukumbu.

67
00:05:07,155 --> 00:05:10,655
Ninataka kununua pia.

68
00:05:10,678 --> 00:05:14,993
Basi, twende dukani.

69
00:05:15,017 --> 00:05:20,117
Kesho tutaenda upande wa bahari.

70
00:05:20,140 --> 00:05:23,473
Waa, bahari?

71
00:05:23,496 --> 00:05:27,329
Ninangoja kwa hamu sana!

72
00:05:27,352 --> 00:05:36,338
Ukipewa jibu, tafadhali uandike katika maoni.

73
00:05:36,338 --> 00:05:39,338
Sehemu ya 3: Mahali patakatifu pa Kamakura - Kivuko cha reli / Kamakura's Famous Scenic Railroad Crossing

74
00:05:39,338 --> 00:05:45,872
Tumefika Kamakura kwa kutumia treni ya Enoshima.

75
00:05:45,894 --> 00:05:51,930
Tuliona bahari ya buluu kutoka kwenye treni, ilikuwa nzuri mno!

76
00:05:51,953 --> 00:06:00,299
Hapa ni mahali patakatifu pa anime ya mpira wa kikapu, na ni maarufu duniani kote.

77
00:06:00,323 --> 00:06:05,002
Hii ni kivuko cha reli cha Kamakura Koko mae, sivyo?

78
00:06:05,025 --> 00:06:08,059
Ndiyo.

79
00:06:08,082 --> 00:06:13,315
Ni kivuko ambacho mhusika mkuu alisimama katika sehemu ya kwanza.

80
00:06:13,338 --> 00:06:18,716
Aa, watu wengi wamekusanyika huko!

81
00:06:18,740 --> 00:06:24,407
Wote wanangoja treni ya kijani kupita.

82
00:06:24,430 --> 00:06:32,330
Ni maarufu kwa sababu unaweza kuona bahari, kivuko na treni pamoja.

83
00:06:32,353 --> 00:06:38,086
Tukipiga picha mara tu treni inapofika.

84
00:06:38,109 --> 00:06:41,661
Treni itakuja lini?

85
00:06:41,685 --> 00:06:46,385
Inapaswa kuja baada ya dakika mbili hivi.

86
00:06:46,408 --> 00:06:49,841
Tayarisha kamera yako.

87
00:06:49,864 --> 00:06:52,532
Sawa, nimeelewa.

88
00:06:52,556 --> 00:06:55,789
Ninahisi msisimko!

89
00:06:55,812 --> 00:07:00,646
Aa, ninaweza kusikia sauti ya "kankan kan".

90
00:07:00,669 --> 00:07:03,635
Treni inakuja!

91
00:07:03,658 --> 00:07:08,168
Treni nzuri ya kijani imefika.

92
00:07:08,192 --> 00:07:10,658
Nitapiga picha.

93
00:07:10,681 --> 00:07:14,592
Umepiga vizuri?

94
00:07:14,616 --> 00:07:16,794
Ndiyo.

95
00:07:16,817 --> 00:07:20,851
Nimepiga picha nzuri ya treni na bahari.

96
00:07:20,874 --> 00:07:23,707
Ni bora kabisa!

97
00:07:23,730 --> 00:07:26,563
Nimefurahi.

98
00:07:26,586 --> 00:07:31,820
Tutakula kitu kitamu hapa karibu?

99
00:07:31,843 --> 00:07:35,076
Kuna chakula gani maarufu?

100
00:07:35,099 --> 00:07:40,966
Donburi ya shirasu (samaki wadogo) ni maarufu hapa!

101
00:07:40,989 --> 00:07:44,889
Waa, chakula cha bahari!

102
00:07:44,912 --> 00:07:48,056
Ninapenda kula!

103
00:07:48,079 --> 00:07:52,418
Basi, tutafute duka nzuri.

104
00:07:52,441 --> 00:07:54,635
Sawa.

105
00:07:54,659 --> 00:07:57,725
Nina njaa.

106
00:07:57,748 --> 00:08:00,748
Sehemu ya 4: Onseni za Hakone na mandhari ya anime ya roboti / Hakone Hot Springs and the Setting of a Robot Anime

107
00:08:00,748 --> 00:08:07,627
Tumefika Hakone, eneo maarufu la matawani huko Kanagawa.

108
00:08:07,651 --> 00:08:15,087
Kuna milima mingi hapa, mandhari yanatofautiana kabisa na Tokyo.

109
00:08:15,110 --> 00:08:21,077
Hapa ndipo mahali ambapo filamu ya roboti ilitokea.

110
00:08:21,100 --> 00:08:27,667
Ni mji wa tatu wa kisasa unaoonekana kwenye filamu na anime.

111
00:08:27,690 --> 00:08:35,556
Ndiyo. Leo tutaenda Owakudani kwa kutumia ropeway.

112
00:08:35,579 --> 00:08:40,313
Tutakiona nini huko Owakudani?

113
00:08:40,336 --> 00:08:47,715
Kuna moshi mweupe kutoka milimani, ni ajabu sana!

114
00:08:47,738 --> 00:08:52,455
Aa, ropeway imeshaanza kusogea!

115
00:08:52,478 --> 00:08:56,220
Tazama mandhari kutoka juu.

116
00:08:56,244 --> 00:09:00,344
Inafanana na sehemu ya anime.

117
00:09:00,367 --> 00:09:03,316
Ndiyo, kweli.

118
00:09:03,339 --> 00:09:08,491
Ni kidogo ya kutisha, lakini ni nzuri sana.

119
00:09:08,514 --> 00:09:15,833
Tukiwasili Owakudani, kuna kitu ambacho lazima kila mtu akilie.

120
00:09:15,856 --> 00:09:18,290
Ni nini?

121
00:09:18,313 --> 00:09:22,487
Mayai yaliyochemshwa meusi.

122
00:09:22,510 --> 00:09:26,706
Inasemekana kwamba kama ukila, utaongeza miaka ya maisha yako.

123
00:09:26,729 --> 00:09:30,481
Mayai meusi?

124
00:09:30,505 --> 00:09:33,572
Ni ya kushangaza!

125
00:09:33,595 --> 00:09:39,674
Hata wahusika wa anime walila mayai hapa.

126
00:09:39,698 --> 00:09:44,635
Basi, na mimi nitakula bila shaka.

127
00:09:44,658 --> 00:09:49,768
Kuna watu wengi wanaosubiri dukani.

128
00:09:49,791 --> 00:09:52,758
Twende kusubiri pamoja.

129
00:09:52,781 --> 00:09:55,053
Ndiyo.

130
00:09:55,076 --> 00:10:00,459
Baadaye tutaingia kwenye bafu ya moto na kupumzika.

131
00:10:00,482 --> 00:10:03,053
Sawa, nzuri.

132
00:10:03,077 --> 00:10:06,915
Inaonekana nitapata nafuu baada ya safari hii.

133
00:10:06,939 --> 00:10:09,939
Sehemu ya 5: Ziwa Motosu na Mlima Fuji / Ziwa Motosu na Mlima Fuji

134
00:10:09,939 --> 00:10:15,693
Tumefika Ziwa Motosu huko Yamanashi.

135
00:10:15,716 --> 00:10:21,483
Hewa ni safi na ni mahali pa kimya sana.

136
00:10:21,507 --> 00:10:28,473
Hapa ndipo mahali ambapo anime ya camping ilianza.

137
00:10:28,496 --> 00:10:32,648
Ni eneo la kambi la Hon'an.

138
00:10:32,672 --> 00:10:35,868
Ndiyo.

139
00:10:35,892 --> 00:10:41,158
Unaweza kuona Mlima Fuji mzuri kutoka hapa.

140
00:10:41,181 --> 00:10:45,779
Waa, ni kweli!

141
00:10:45,802 --> 00:10:51,536
Unaweza kuona Mlima Fuji mkubwa ukitazama ng'ambo ya ziwa.

142
00:10:51,559 --> 00:11:00,034
Mandhari haya ni sawa na ile picha iliyo kwenye noti ya elfu moja ya Kijapani.

143
00:11:00,057 --> 00:11:03,291
Aa, ni kweli?

144
00:11:03,315 --> 00:11:08,822
Nitatoa noti ya elfu moja kutoka pochi yangu ili tuangalie.

145
00:11:08,845 --> 00:11:11,396
Vipi?

146
00:11:11,420 --> 00:11:14,286
Ni sawa, sivyo?

147
00:11:14,309 --> 00:11:20,343
Ni ajabu, mandhari ni sawa kabisa!

148
00:11:20,366 --> 00:11:25,199
Hata wahusika wa anime walikuja hapa.

149
00:11:25,222 --> 00:11:27,924
Ndiyo.

150
00:11:27,948 --> 00:11:33,745
Walikuwa wanacamp hapa wakitazama Mlima Fuji.

151
00:11:33,768 --> 00:11:39,151
Je, tujipumzike kidogo?

152
00:11:39,175 --> 00:11:46,249
Tunyweni chai moto wakati tunatazama Mlima Fuji.

153
00:11:46,272 --> 00:11:48,972
Ni nzuri sana.

154
00:11:48,995 --> 00:11:53,829
Ni mahali pa kimya na moyo unapata amani.

155
00:11:53,852 --> 00:12:00,918
Inasemekana kwamba baada ya kuangalia anime, watu wengi wanataka kucamp hapa.

156
00:12:00,941 --> 00:12:06,975
Mandhari ni mazuri, hivyo naelewa hisia zao.

157
00:12:06,998 --> 00:12:12,264
Kesho tutaenda upande wa magharibi zaidi.

158
00:12:12,287 --> 00:12:15,521
Tutakwenda wapi?

159
00:12:15,543 --> 00:12:22,514
Tutatumia shinkansen kwenda mji wenye shule ya zamani.

160
00:12:22,538 --> 00:12:27,044
Ninafurahia kusikia kuhusu shule hiyo.

161
00:12:27,067 --> 00:12:30,067
Sehemu ya 6: Safari ya Mahali Patakatifu ya Anime huko Toyosato / Safari ya Mahali Patakatifu ya Anime huko Toyosato

162
00:12:30,067 --> 00:12:35,534
Tumefika Toyosato, Shiga.

163
00:12:35,557 --> 00:12:41,892
Tulitembea kidogo kutoka stesheni, mji huu ni wa kimya na mzuri sana.

164
00:12:41,915 --> 00:12:44,782
Tazama hapa.

165
00:12:44,805 --> 00:12:51,272
Hiyo ni jengo la shule ya zamani.

166
00:12:51,295 --> 00:12:58,028
Waa! Jengo hili ni kubwa na zuri sana!

167
00:12:58,051 --> 00:13:05,963
Hii ni shule iliyomodeliwa kwa ajili ya anime ya muziki inayoitwa K-On!

168
00:13:05,987 --> 00:13:12,320
Ni shule ambapo wanachama wa bendi ya K-On! walifanya mazoezi ya muziki.

169
00:13:12,343 --> 00:13:15,443
Ndiyo.

170
00:13:15,466 --> 00:13:20,566
Unaweza kuingia na kutazama ndani.

171
00:13:20,589 --> 00:13:24,861
Mtu anayetusaidia ni mzuri sana.

172
00:13:24,885 --> 00:13:31,637
Kuna mapambo ya sungura na kobe kwenye handrails za ngazi.

173
00:13:31,661 --> 00:13:36,328
Mapambo hayo yanaonekana kama yalivyo katika anime.

174
00:13:36,351 --> 00:13:40,263
Unajua vizuri sana!

175
00:13:40,286 --> 00:13:44,753
Twende kwenye chumba cha klabu kilicho katika ghorofa ya tatu.

176
00:13:44,776 --> 00:13:47,749
Ndiyo, nataka kwenda.

177
00:13:47,773 --> 00:13:54,149
Katika chumba hicho, walikuwa wanakunywa chai na kula vitabu.

178
00:13:54,172 --> 00:14:01,672
Ndani ya chumba kuna meza, viti, na ubao mweusi.

179
00:14:01,695 --> 00:14:07,196
Kuna vyombo vya muziki na kikombe cha chai vilivyopelekwa na mashabiki.

180
00:14:07,219 --> 00:14:13,253
Inaonekana kama tumeingia katika ulimwengu wa anime, na nina furaha sana!

181
00:14:13,276 --> 00:14:18,209
Unaweza kuandika ujumbe kwenye ubao mweusi.

182
00:14:18,232 --> 00:14:23,826
Basi, nitaandika ujumbe kwa lugha ya nchi yangu.

183
00:14:23,849 --> 00:14:26,549
Sawa, nzuri.

184
00:14:26,572 --> 00:14:29,639
Itakuwa kumbukumbu.

185
00:14:29,662 --> 00:14:35,529
Leo nimeshika fursa ya kuona shule ya zamani, na ni nzuri sana.

186
00:14:35,552 --> 00:14:42,852
Sasa, twende mahali maalum zaidi kwenye milimani.

187
00:14:42,875 --> 00:14:46,069
Ndiyo, twende.

188
00:14:46,092 --> 00:14:49,092
Sehemu ya 7: Mwamba wa Upanga wa Hadithi ya Yagyu

189
00:14:49,092 --> 00:14:56,392
Tumekuja kutembea katika milima ya Yagyu huko Nara.

190
00:14:56,415 --> 00:15:02,589
Kila upande kuna miti, na ni baridi kidogo.

191
00:15:02,612 --> 00:15:08,846
Wengi wa mashabiki wa Kimetsu no Yaiba wanakuja hapa.

192
00:15:08,869 --> 00:15:13,435
Kuna nini katika milima hii?

193
00:15:13,458 --> 00:15:17,653
Kuna mwamba mkubwa sana.

194
00:15:17,677 --> 00:15:22,511
Unaitwa Yagyu Itto-seki.

195
00:15:22,534 --> 00:15:26,267
Yagyu Itto-seki?

196
00:15:26,290 --> 00:15:29,323
Ni mwamba wa aina gani?

197
00:15:29,346 --> 00:15:37,813
Unafanana sana na mwamba ambao Tanjiro alikata kwa upanga wake.

198
00:15:37,836 --> 00:15:43,417
Aa, ni mwamba ambao unatokea mwisho wa mazoezi yake.

199
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:46,940
Aa, unaonekana sasa.

200
00:15:46,963 --> 00:15:50,532
Ni mwamba mkubwa ule.

201
00:15:50,555 --> 00:15:57,789
Inaonekana kweli umekatwa vizuri katikati.

202
00:15:57,812 --> 00:16:06,487
Kuna hadithi kwamba shujaa maarufu wa upanga wa enzi ya Edo alikatwa na Tengu, na hivyo mwamba uligawanyika.

203
00:16:06,511 --> 00:16:10,411
Ni mwamba wa hadithi basi.

204
00:16:10,434 --> 00:16:15,606
Hivyo ndivyo ulivyogawanyika vizuri.

205
00:16:15,629 --> 00:16:20,427
Kuna upanga wa mbao mbele ya mwamba.

206
00:16:20,450 --> 00:16:27,717
Naweza kupiga picha kwa kutumia upanga huo kwa mkao wa shujaa?

207
00:16:27,741 --> 00:16:30,974
Ndiyo, unaweza.

208
00:16:30,997 --> 00:16:34,531
Chukua upanga.

209
00:16:34,554 --> 00:16:37,940
Basi, nitaanza.

210
00:16:37,963 --> 00:16:43,557
Mkusanyiko wote. Piga picha.

211
00:16:43,581 --> 00:16:46,914
Umepiga picha nzuri sana.

212
00:16:46,937 --> 00:16:49,637
Asante.

213
00:16:49,660 --> 00:16:54,493
Nina hisia kama mhusika mkuu wa anime.

214
00:16:54,516 --> 00:16:58,750
Nafurahi umefurahi.

215
00:16:58,773 --> 00:17:02,540
Mazingira ya hapa yanaonekana nzuri sana, sivyo?

216
00:17:02,564 --> 00:17:08,955
Ndiyo. Katika msitu tulivu hivi, unaweza kusikia historia.

217
00:17:08,978 --> 00:17:14,335
Basi, twende kushuka mlima na kwenda Kyoto.

218
00:17:14,359 --> 00:17:18,993
Je, Kyoto kuna maeneo matakatifu gani?

219
00:17:19,015 --> 00:17:24,652
Ni hekalu linalojulikana kutoka katika anime ya uchunguzi maarufu.

220
00:17:24,675 --> 00:17:27,675
Mstari wa 8: Hekalu la Fushimi Inari na Milango Elfu ya Torii

221
00:17:27,675 --> 00:17:33,148
Tumefika Hekalu Kuu la Fushimi Inari huko Kyoto.

222
00:17:33,172 --> 00:17:40,205
Milango myekundu mingi hivi, ni nzuri sana!

223
00:17:40,228 --> 00:17:48,773
Hapa ni mahali pa filamu nyingi za anime, ikiwa ni pamoja na zile za Detective Conan.

224
00:17:48,797 --> 00:17:54,163
Ni filamu ya 'Crossroads in the Ancient Capital,' ndiyo?

225
00:17:54,186 --> 00:17:58,053
Unaikumbuka vizuri sana!

226
00:17:58,076 --> 00:18:03,383
Kuna sehemu ambapo wanapita kwenye njia ya milango hii.

227
00:18:03,407 --> 00:18:10,195
Milango inakwenda milele, inafanana na ulimwengu wa ajabu.

228
00:18:10,219 --> 00:18:18,592
Inaitwa 'Senbon Torii,' ingawa kwa kweli kuna zaidi ya hiyo.

229
00:18:18,615 --> 00:18:25,281
Nimesikia kwamba ni mahali ambapo watalii wa kigeni wanapenda kwenda zaidi.

230
00:18:25,304 --> 00:18:31,046
Ndiyo, kila siku kuna watu wengi sana.

231
00:18:31,070 --> 00:18:37,174
Kama utakwea hadi juu, inachukua muda gani?

232
00:18:37,197 --> 00:18:43,430
Kama utazunguka mlima mzima, inachukua saa mbili hivi.

233
00:18:43,453 --> 00:18:47,420
Saa mbili ni muda mrefu, sivyo?

234
00:18:47,443 --> 00:18:51,551
Leo twende kidogo tu.

235
00:18:51,574 --> 00:18:54,851
Sawa, twende kidogo.

236
00:18:54,874 --> 00:19:01,107
Mwanga unaopenya kati ya milango hii ni mzuri sana!

237
00:19:01,130 --> 00:19:07,464
Ndiyo. Popote pa kupiga picha, huwa ni mandhari nzuri.

238
00:19:07,487 --> 00:19:13,657
Kama utasikiliza wimbo wa filamu ukitembea, utakuwa na furaha zaidi.

239
00:19:13,680 --> 00:19:17,314
Hiyo ni wazo zuri!

240
00:19:17,338 --> 00:19:21,605
Tutasikiliza kwa simu yangu.

241
00:19:21,628 --> 00:19:27,494
Furahia hali ya hekalu la kitamaduni la Kijapani.

242
00:19:27,517 --> 00:19:34,451
Ndiyo. Nimefurahi sana kuja Kyoto.

243
00:19:34,474 --> 00:19:41,307
Leo tumetembea sana, basi usiku tutapumzika vizuri.

244
00:19:41,330 --> 00:19:45,311
Ninapenda kula kitu kitamu.

245
00:19:45,334 --> 00:19:50,201
Tumeandaa chakula maalum cha Kyoto.

246
00:19:50,224 --> 00:19:53,939
Waa, ninafurahi kusikia hiyo!

247
00:19:53,962 --> 00:19:56,962
Mstari wa 9: Hoteli ya Kijapani na Uzoefu wa Onsen huko Kyoto

248
00:19:56,962 --> 00:20:03,429
Leo tutalala katika hoteli ya kitamaduni ya Kyoto.

249
00:20:03,452 --> 00:20:08,685
Chumba chenye tatami kinatoa utulivu mkubwa.

250
00:20:08,708 --> 00:20:14,608
Badilisha nguo na uvae yukata, kwanza twende onsen.

251
00:20:14,631 --> 00:20:21,298
Ni mara yangu ya kwanza kuingia onsen ya Kijapani, naona wasiwasi kidogo.

252
00:20:21,321 --> 00:20:26,988
Maji ni moto, basi ingia polepole.

253
00:20:27,011 --> 00:20:31,277
Nitakuwa makini.

254
00:20:31,300 --> 00:20:37,634
Baada ya kuondoka kwenye bafu, chakula kitamu cha jioni kinangojea.

255
00:20:37,657 --> 00:20:42,690
Waa, je, hii ni chakula cha Kyoto?

256
00:20:42,713 --> 00:20:47,425
Sahani ni ndogo na nzuri.

257
00:20:47,449 --> 00:20:55,016
Inaitwa 'Kyoto-ryori,' hutumia mboga za msimu na dengu nyingi.

258
00:20:55,039 --> 00:21:00,306
Ladha ni tamu na nzuri sana.

259
00:21:00,329 --> 00:21:06,567
Tukiwa tunakula, tuangalie picha za safari yetu mpaka sasa.

260
00:21:06,590 --> 00:21:09,161
Ni nzuri sana.

261
00:21:09,185 --> 00:21:13,218
Tutaziona kwenye skrini ya simu.

262
00:21:13,241 --> 00:21:19,992
Picha ya ngazi za Yotsuya ya kwanza, ni nzuri sana!

263
00:21:20,015 --> 00:21:27,648
Pia, picha ya kona ya Kamakura High School ina treni nzuri.

264
00:21:27,671 --> 00:21:34,771
Picha ya mbele ya jiwe kubwa huko Nara, ukishika katana ya mbao, ni ya kuvutia.

265
00:21:34,794 --> 00:21:41,332
Kila mahali tulipoenda palifanana na anime, na nimechangamka sana.

266
00:21:41,356 --> 00:21:48,075
Niliona mandhari nyingi nzuri za Japani, safari nzuri ilikuwa.

267
00:21:48,099 --> 00:21:54,455
Ndiyo. Unaweza kupanga safari vizuri sana.

268
00:21:54,478 --> 00:21:57,178
Asante.

269
00:21:57,201 --> 00:22:01,901
Ninapata furaha kusikia hivyo, niko na furaha pia.

270
00:22:01,924 --> 00:22:07,510
Kesho ndio siku ya mwisho ya safari yetu.

271
00:22:07,534 --> 00:22:13,367
Ni huzuni, lakini tufurahie hadi mwisho kesho.

272
00:22:13,390 --> 00:22:17,290
Ndiyo, lala salama.

273
00:22:17,313 --> 00:22:20,313
Sehemu ya 10: Kumbukumbu za Safari ya Kutembelea Maeneo Matakatifu ya Anime

274
00:22:20,313 --> 00:22:27,346
Leo ndio mwisho wa safari yetu ya kutembelea maeneo matakatifu ya anime.

275
00:22:27,369 --> 00:22:35,145
Kabla ya kurudi Tokyo kwa shinkansen, tulinunua zawadi nyingi.

276
00:22:35,169 --> 00:22:41,728
Stesheni ya Kyoto ni kubwa sana na jengo la kisasa.

277
00:22:41,752 --> 00:22:51,452
Ndiyo. Ingawa kuna mahekalu ya kale mengi, stesheni ni mpya sana na niliogopa.

278
00:22:51,475 --> 00:22:58,308
Katika safari hii, ni mahali gani pa maeneo matakatifu ulipopenda zaidi?

279
00:22:58,331 --> 00:23:07,869
Mimi nilipendezwa zaidi na daraja la reli karibu na bahari huko Kamakura.

280
00:23:07,892 --> 00:23:13,028
Bahari ya Shonan ilikuwa nzuri sana.

281
00:23:13,052 --> 00:23:18,919
Wewe, ni mahali gani ulipopenda zaidi?

282
00:23:18,942 --> 00:23:28,408
Nilipendezwa na miamba mikubwa iliyogawanyika katika milima ya Nara.

283
00:23:28,431 --> 00:23:36,023
Pale palikuwa kimya na kama ulimwengu wa anime kweli.

284
00:23:36,046 --> 00:23:43,113
Safari ijayo, ungependa kutembelea maeneo matakatifu gani?

285
00:23:43,136 --> 00:23:51,036
Ningependa kwenda Ghibli Park na maeneo matakatifu ya filamu huko Kyushu.

286
00:23:51,059 --> 00:23:53,658
Sawa, nzuri.

287
00:23:53,682 --> 00:23:58,915
Kyushu pia kuna maeneo mazuri mengi.

288
00:23:58,938 --> 00:24:05,039
Watazamaji wenzetu, ni maeneo matakatifu gani ya anime mnapenda?

289
00:24:05,062 --> 00:24:09,981
Tafadhali mtuambie kwenye sehemu ya maoni.

290
00:24:10,004 --> 00:24:15,038
Ningependa kujua pia maeneo ya anime unayopenda.

291
00:24:15,061 --> 00:24:21,161
Karibu muda wa shinkansen, twende kwenye jukwaa.

292
00:24:21,184 --> 00:24:26,284
Ndiyo, twende Tokyo.

293
00:24:26,307 --> 00:24:31,807
Watazamaji wenzetu, tutaonana tena katika video ya safari ijayo.

294
00:24:31,830 --> 00:24:34,530
Kwa heri.